cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or the accompanying paper, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Face Embedding Map: raw-pixel Eigenfaces vs frozen deep face embeddings, with a webcam illumination study"
abstract: >-
  A controlled replication and measurement study comparing a raw-pixel Eigenfaces representation
  (PCA on 4096-d Olivetti faces) with a frozen VGGFace2-pretrained Inception-ResNet-v1 embedding
  (512-d unit vectors), using identical PCA settings and full-dimensional metrics, plus an open-set
  verification protocol and a one-subject webcam study of lighting intensity and direction.
authors:
